From 173b7aa32931847ae758b5d0e89660b9db09663a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Carl Lee <carl.lee@amd.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 18:53:08 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] configurations: anacapa: support multi source configurations

Anacapa boards are populated with multiple alternate component
sources(ADC/VR/TEMP/FSC/HSC/retimer). Replace each single main-source
config with per-source configs selected by the BOARD_INFO_AM4 FRU
field, so the correct sensors are exposed for each source.
Previously only BOARD_PRODUCT_NAME / BOARD_MANUFACTURER were matched
; all variants keep that match (excluding EVT1/EVT2) and add the
BOARD_INFO_AM4 string below.

MB:
- ADC-TI MEMVR-MPS CPUVR-MPS SOCVR-MPS PVDD33VR-MPS PVDD18VR-MPS
- ADC-PJ MEMVR-RNS CPUVR-RNS SOCVR-RNS PVDD33VR-INF PVDD18VR-INF
- ADC-TI MEMVR-RNS CPUVR-RNS SOCVR-RNS PVDD33VR-INF PVDD18VR-INF

Bridge L / Bridge R:
- RETIMER-ASTERA TMP-TI
- RETIMER-ASTERA TMP-MCHP
- RETIMER-KANDOU TMP-TI
- RETIMER-KANDOU TMP-MCHP

PDB L:
- TMP-TI FSC-MAX HSC-ADI SWVR-DLTA
- TMP-MC FSC-NCT HSC-ADI SWVR-FLEX
- TMP-MC FSC-NCT HSC-ADI SWVR-DLTA
- TMP-MC FSC-NCT HSC-MPS SWVR-FLEX

PDB R:
- TMP8-TI TMP29-TI FSC-MAX ADC-TI HSC-ADI MBVR-DLTA STBYVR-DLTA
- TMP8-MC TMP29-MC FSC-NCT ADC-PJ HSC-ADI MBVR-LUX STBYVR-DLTA
- TMP8-MC TMP29-MC FSC-NCT ADC-PJ HSC-ADI MBVR-DLTA STBYVR-DLTA
- TMP8-MC TMP29-MC FSC-NCT ADC-PJ HSC-MPS MBVR-LUX STBYVR-DLTA
- TMP8-MC TMP29-MC FSC-NCT ADC-PJ HSC-MPS MBVR-LUX STBYVR-MUR

Tested:
- Built entity-manager successfully.
- Verified all configuration files parse correctly.
- Verified the expected configuration is selected based on the
  BOARD_INFO_AM4 FRU field on target hardware.

Gerrit: https://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/entity-manager/+/96001

Change-Id: I16033e12cfa4e32f6d8bba5e7a7fb93972b67ca1
Signed-off-by: Carl Lee <carl.lee@amd.com>
